# ============================================================
#  Spells (design §9.1): 2 per discipline, 3 levels each.
#  cost: mana per level · power: strength per level (tunable).
#  Data only until phase 2a adds the swipe-up spell option.
# ============================================================

@spell flame
name: Flame
discipline: evocation
cost: 6, 5, 4
power: 1, 2, 3
art: flame
desc: Fire from the fingertips: a candle's worth at first, a bonfire's later. Burns through wards that only expect cleverness.

@spell tide
name: Tide
discipline: evocation
cost: 8, 6, 5
power: 1, 2, 3
art: wave
desc: Water called up and moved: a wave, a wall, a lake politely asked to step aside.

@spell foresight
name: Foresight
discipline: astromancy
cost: 6, 5, 4
power: 1, 2, 3
art: eye
desc: A glimpse of the next few moments. Enough to know which way the dice will fall, sometimes.

@spell starlight
name: Starlight
discipline: astromancy
cost: 10, 8, 6
power: 1, 2, 3
art: star
desc: The light of a named star, held in the hand. Darkness that eats light finds it hard to swallow.

@spell mend
name: Mend
discipline: alchemy
cost: 6, 5, 4
power: 1, 2, 3
art: heart
desc: Knits cuts, cracks and broken teacups. Hearts take longer.

@spell purify
name: Purify
discipline: alchemy
cost: 8, 6, 5
power: 1, 2, 3
art: potion
desc: Draws out poison, curse-cold and bad ingredients. The cure has to come from somewhere; it leaves you tired.

@spell glamour
name: Glamour
discipline: illusion
cost: 5, 4, 3
power: 1, 2, 3
art: mask
desc: A little more charm than you really have. People remember liking you and not quite why.

@spell mirror
name: Mirror
discipline: illusion
cost: 8, 6, 5
power: 1, 2, 3
art: mirror
desc: A double of yourself, or of anything you can see. It doesn't talk, which is its only flaw.

@spell haste
name: Haste
discipline: beastcraft
cost: 6, 5, 4
power: 1, 2, 3
art: bolt
desc: Speed borrowed from hares and hawks. You act first; you pay for it with a long nap.

@spell beast_speech
name: Beast-speech
discipline: beastcraft
cost: 6, 5, 4
power: 1, 2, 3
art: paw
desc: Talk with animals, briefly. Most of them have been waiting to complain.

@spell ward
name: Ward
discipline: umbral
cost: 8, 6, 5
power: 1, 2, 3
art: shield
desc: A pale shell that turns aside the next harm.

@spell shadowstep
name: Shadowstep
discipline: umbral
cost: 10, 8, 6
power: 1, 2, 3
art: ghost
desc: Step into one shadow and out of another. Short distances only; the shadows in between are not friendly.
